{
  "page": 448,
  "lang": "ar",
  "edition": "quran-uthmani",
  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 3840,
      "text": "yang berkata, \"Apakah sesungguhnya kamu termasuk orang-orang yang membenarkan (hari berbangkit)?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 52,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 448,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3841,
      "text": "Apabila kita telah mati dan telah menjadi tanah dan tulang-belulang, apakah kita benar-benar (akan dibangkitkan) untuk diberi pembalasan?\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 53,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 448,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3842,
      "text": "Dia berkata, \"Maukah kamu meninjau (temanku itu)?\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 54,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 448,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3843,
      "text": "Maka dia meninjaunya, lalu dia melihat (teman)nya itu di tengah-tengah neraka yang menyala-nyala.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 55,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 448,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3844,
      "text": "Dia berkata, \"Demi Allah, engkau hampir saja mencelakakanku,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 56,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 448,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3845,
      "text": "dan sekiranya bukan karena nikmat Tuhanku pastilah aku termasuk orang-orang yang diseret (ke neraka).\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 57,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 448,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3846,
      "text": "Maka apakah kita tidak akan mati?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 58,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 448,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3847,
      "text": "Kecuali kematian kita yang pertama saja (di dunia), dan kita tidak akan diazab (di akhirat ini)?\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 59,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 448,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3848,
      "text": "Sungguh, ini benar-benar kemenangan yang agung.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 60,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 448,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3849,
      "text": "Untuk (kemenangan) serupa ini, hendaklah beramal orang-orang yang mampu beramal.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 61,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 448,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3850,
      "text": "Apakah (makanan surga) itu hidangan yang lebih baik ataukah pohon zaqqum.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 62,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 448,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3851,
      "text": "Sungguh, Kami menjadikannya (pohon zaqqum) sebagai azab bagi orang-orang zalim.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 63,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 448,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3852,
      "text": "Sungguh, itu adalah pohon yang keluar dari dasar neraka Jahim,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 64,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 448,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3853,
      "text": "mayangnya seperti kepala-kepala setan.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 65,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 448,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3854,
      "text": "Maka sungguh, mereka benar-benar memakan sebagian darinya (buah pohon itu), dan mereka memenuhi perutnya dengan buahnya (zaqqum).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 66,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 448,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3855,
      "text": "Kemudian sungguh, setelah makan (buah zaqqum) mereka mendapat minuman yang dicampur dengan air yang sangat panas.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 67,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 448,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3856,
      "text": "Kemudian pasti tempat kembali mereka ke neraka Jahim.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 68,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 448,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3857,
      "text": "Sesungguhnya mereka mendapati nenek moyang mereka dalam keadaan sesat,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 69,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 448,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3858,
      "text": "lalu mereka tergesa-gesa mengikuti jejak (nenek moyang) mereka.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 70,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 448,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3859,
      "text": "Dan sungguh, sebelum mereka (suku Quraisy), telah sesat sebagian besar dari orang-orang yang dahulu.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 71,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 448,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3860,
      "text": "Dan sungguh, Kami telah mengutus (rasul) pemberi peringatan di kalangan mereka.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 72,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 448,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3861,
      "text": "Maka perhatikanlah bagaimana kesudahan orang-orang yang diberi peringatan itu,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 73,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 448,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3862,
      "text": "kecuali hamba-hamba Allah yang disucikan (dari dosa).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 74,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 448,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3863,
      "text": "Dan sungguh, Nuh telah berdoa kepada Kami, maka sungguh, Kamilah sebaik-baik yang memperkenankan doa.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 75,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 448,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3864,
      "text": "Kami telah menyelamatkan dia dan pengikutnya dari bencana yang besar.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 76,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 448,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    }
  ],
